WEBVTT

00:00:24.455 --> 00:00:27.815
♪ Unforgettable

00:00:28.295 --> 00:00:30.575
♪ In every way

00:00:35.135 --> 00:00:38.375
♪ And forever more

00:00:38.655 --> 00:00:41.815
♪ That's how you'll stay

00:00:45.695 --> 00:00:50.895
♪ That's why, darling, it's incredible

00:00:51.415 --> 00:00:55.815
♪ That someone so unforgettable

00:00:57.655 --> 00:01:00.375
♪ Thinks that I am

00:01:00.895 --> 00:01:05.015
♪ Unforgettable, too ♪

00:06:28.975 --> 00:06:30.335
(BIRDS SQUAWKING)

00:06:51.055 --> 00:06:54.855
BOTH: Off, off, off, off, off,
off, off, off, off, off!

00:06:56.535 --> 00:06:57.575
(BLOAT PANTING)

00:06:57.695 --> 00:06:59.975
BLOAT: Come on. Roll, roll.
That's it. Hurry!

00:07:00.055 --> 00:07:01.375
That's it. Just roll!

00:07:01.535 --> 00:07:02.175
PEACH: I'm right behind you.

00:07:02.375 --> 00:07:04.895
GILL: You can do it!
Just a little farther. That's it!

00:07:05.055 --> 00:07:07.255
GURGLE: I am truly going to vomit!

00:07:07.895 --> 00:07:10.535
-JACQUES: Voilà!
-All right, gang, good work.

00:07:10.655 --> 00:07:11.895
(ALL CHEERING)

00:07:12.015 --> 00:07:14.215
Look, Flo, we made it!

00:07:14.375 --> 00:07:16.975
We won't have any more problems
from here on out.

00:07:17.055 --> 00:07:18.055
(ALL GASP)

00:07:19.575 --> 00:07:20.895
No respect for ocean life.

00:07:21.895 --> 00:07:22.895
BLOAT: Now what?

00:07:27.575 --> 00:07:29.095
(YAWNING)

00:07:34.255 --> 00:07:35.895
(SNICKERING)

